<section class="admin-page-head"><div><p class="admin-kicker">PRECIOS</p><h1><?= $price===null?'Nuevo precio':'Editar precio' ?></h1><p>Todo precio nace inactivo y requiere categoría fiscal y criterio explícito de impuesto.</p></div><a class="admin-secondary-button" href="/admin/prices">Volver</a></section>
<?php if($branches===[]||$variants===[]||$lists===[]||$taxes===[]):?><div class="admin-panel admin-empty"><strong>No es posible registrar el precio todavía.</strong><span>Se requieren sucursal, variante, lista y categoría fiscal activas/autorizadas.</span></div><?php else:?><form class="admin-panel admin-form" method="post" action="/admin/prices/save"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="<?= e($csrf) ?>"><?php if($price!==null):?><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= e($price['id']) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="lock_version" value="<?= e($price['lock_version']) ?>"><?php endif?><div class="admin-form-grid"><label class="admin-field"><span>Sucursal</span><select name="branch_id" required><?php foreach($branches as$b):?><option value="<?= e($b['id']) ?>" <?= (int)($price['branch_id']??0)===(int)$b['id']?'selected':'' ?>><?= e($b['name']) ?><?= (int)$b['is_active']!==1?' · inactiva':'' ?></option><?php endforeach?></select></label><label class="admin-field"><span>Variante</span><select name="variant_id" required><?php foreach($variants as$v):?><option value="<?= e($v['id']) ?>" <?= (int)($price['variant_id']??0)===(int)$v['id']?'selected':'' ?>><?= e($v['product_name'].' · '.$v['sku'].' · '.$v['name']) ?></option><?php endforeach?></select></label><label class="admin-field"><span>Lista</span><select name="price_list_id" required><?php foreach($lists as$l):?><option value="<?= e($l['id']) ?>" <?= (int)($price['price_list_id']??0)===(int)$l['id']?'selected':'' ?>><?= e($l['name']) ?></option><?php endforeach?></select></label><label class="admin-field"><span>Categoría fiscal</span><select name="tax_category_id" required><?php foreach($taxes as$t):?><option value="<?= e($t['id']) ?>" <?= (int)($price['tax_category_id']??0)===(int)$t['id']?'selected':'' ?>><?= e($t['name']) ?></option><?php endforeach?></select></label><label class="admin-field"><span>Importe MXN</span><input name="amount" inputmode="decimal" pattern="(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:\.[0-9]{1,4})?" required value="<?= e($price['amount']??'') ?>"><small>Cero es un importe válido; ausencia de registro significa sin precio.</small></label><label class="admin-check"><input type="checkbox" name="tax_included" value="1" <?= (int)($price['tax_included']??0)===1?'checked':'' ?>><span>El importe incluye impuesto<small>Debe coincidir con la política confirmada por el negocio.</small></span></label><label class="admin-field"><span>Vigente desde</span><input type="date" name="valid_from" required value="<?= e($price['valid_from']??date('Y-m-d')) ?>"></label><label class="admin-field"><span>Vigente hasta</span><input type="date" name="valid_until" value="<?= e($price['valid_until']??'') ?>"></label></div><button class="admin-primary-button">Guardar precio</button></form><?php endif?>
<?php if($history!==[]):?><section class="admin-panel"><h2>Historial inmutable</h2><ul class="admin-simple-list"><?php foreach($history as$entry):?><li><span><strong><?= e($entry['action']) ?></strong><small><?= e($entry['created_at'].' · '.$entry['actor_name']) ?></small></span><span>#<?= e($entry['id']) ?></span></li><?php endforeach?></ul></section><?php endif?>
